<title>USA: Phillips Cty ESD 14, Mont. won by Harris Trust. [CORRECTED 17:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>Phillips Cty ESD 14, Mont. won by Harris Trust. [CORRECTED 17:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
